-- Nov 22, 2026: Human-I-T nonprofit account created by Stephen; upload page demands a state sales-tax exemption document we do not have. Safe to re-run (marker-guarded).
begin;
update fs_grant_deadlines set
 status='drafting', next_step_due='2026-11-23',
 next_step='Account CREATED by Stephen Nov 22, 2026 (store.human-i-t.org, Gold Member - Non-Profit Organization; IRS determination letter uploaded). The upload page (store.human-i-t.org/upload-documents-non-profit/) has a pre-checked "Tax Exempt" box and then requires "Tax Exempt Document: proof of multistate/state-based sales tax exemption", which we DO NOT HAVE (error "Tax Exempt Document required"). Next (Stephen, Mon Nov 23): uncheck the "Tax Exempt" box and submit with the IRS letter only (we then pay sales tax; the 501(c)(3) membership discount does not depend on it); if the site still requires the document, email Human-I-T through https://store.human-i-t.org/contact-us/ to ask. Separately, the Illinois sales-tax exemption (Illinois Department of Revenue exemption number) is a different process we have not started: research it later (verify eligibility and what it needs, e.g. AG registration). After approval (1-3 business days) ask for a bulk quote for 13 Windows laptops and confirm Chicago delivery. Online only.',
 notes = notes || E'\n2026-11-22 [humanit-account-20261122] Stephen created the Human-I-T nonprofit account (browser saved the password; never store it here) and reached the document upload step. IRS determination letter uploaded. The page then asked for proof of multistate/state-based sales tax exemption; Stephen: "we do not have this". We have no Illinois Department of Revenue sales-tax exemption certificate. Plan: uncheck Tax Exempt and submit IRS letter only; ask Human-I-T by contact form if blocked. Discount is 40-60% off retail, not a donation. Nothing submitted for approval yet, nothing received.'
where id='1bb6960b-2be0-4e7e-9967-944922c080d3' and notes not like '%humanit-account-20261122%';
commit;
select status, next_step_due::text, (notes like '%humanit-account-20261122%') noted from fs_grant_deadlines where id='1bb6960b-2be0-4e7e-9967-944922c080d3';
